.TH DRAW_CLEAR 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
draw_clear \- Fill the whole frame with c
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdraw.h\(dq
.BI "void draw_clear(Color c);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fill the whole frame with c. The engine already clears to EngineConfig.clear_color each frame; call this only to override.
.SH MODULE
draw (src/engine/draw/draw.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR draw_rect (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
